<attribute name="mainDescription" nodeId="3f7a8fbb">&lt;p&gt;
    The organization map details the overall structure of the business. It shows how the business units decompose into
    other business units and also how they interact with the third parties. Organization map is constrained by the
    boundaries of the business.
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    The map might be extended to include other mappings such as:
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Business locations - where the work is carried out
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Technology locations - locations of servers, systems
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Capabilities - what the business does
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Third Parties - third parties/actors that enable capabilities
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Roles - actors assume roles to perform specific tasks in an organization
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</attribute>
<attribute name="externalId" nodeId="cf4c4895"></attribute>
<attribute name="keyConsiderations" nodeId="8d9a6fc2"></attribute>
<attribute name="longPresentationName" nodeId="a63f12cd"></attribute>
<attribute name="purpose" nodeId="3a3614b5">&lt;p&gt;
    The purpose of this artifact is to:
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Provides organizational context useful for strategic planning and analysis.
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Identify key issues that may be driving issues in collaboration and communication.
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Help understand the impact of the various business decisions.
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</attribute>
